   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEATION INCUBATOR : WOMEN LED ENTERPRENEUSHIPJUNE - DEC 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ideation programme in South Africa implemented by I&apos;M IN ENTREPRENEURIAL PROGRAMME NPC aims to contribute to an increase in women and young entrepreneurs, poverty alleviation, employment and business  opportunities for young people and women in South Africa. The ideation incubation program targets women with innovative ideas looking to build tech start-ups. The focus of this programme is to equip young women in underserved communities of Gauteng with entrepreneurial skills and business development support. The program works with under-served higher education institutions students and support them from ideation to prototype. This program is delivered in partnership with JP Morgan and Telkom.</narrative>
  </description>
